0 d Thallus epiphloeodic, white to grey, irregularly warty, P+ red, KC+ red; fertile warts to 1 mm high; discs single, punctiform, later to 0.5 mm wide, blackish; ascospores 70-100 x 30-45 µm; on Quercus in Tunisia; poorly-known taxon 0378185890 P. debazaci Werner0
