0 Discs single, punctiform to deformed, surrounded by smooth, slightly verrucose margin; thallus strongly yellow, thick, rimose-areolated or warted, not zoned at the margin; thiophaninic acid; fertile warts with constricted base, 1-1.2 mm wide, abundant and confluent, rounded, with initially punctiform, later to 0.5 mm wide, flat, smooth; epithecium K+ violet, C+ violet; ascospores 100-170 x 50-70 µm; on Cedrus in Morocco; syn. P. ilicicola var. tazzekensis (INED.?) 04395981030 P. tazzekensis Werner0
